Subject: Re: X on Miata / Mach64 SVGA -> crash 'n burn
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=freebsd-alpha&m=103030594007106

Word of warning: I just corrupted all my filesystems on the Miata MX5
to the extent I'll probably have to reinstall from scratch.

This was running 'x11perf -all' on XF86_S3 and 4.0-RC2 which after 2 minutes
locked up the machine solid. Fsck on reboot knocked out half of the f/s,
DUPs, partially allocated inodes, unknown inodes etc.

Disk is SCSI on Qlogic 1040 on the 32bit PCI slots (behind the bridge).

