How much memory does the box have?  More than 256 Mbytes?  I had similar 
symptoms with a couple of boxes with 512M.  This saved me:

http://www.aspsys.com/docs/UNIXWorkaround.txt

Basically, "boot -flag I" and when it asks for kernel options type
 "vmunix memlimit=256".




